  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p>You may use control mishap on a technological item whenever it would trigger a glitch and may use hack magic on technological items as if they were magic items. You may also coax a mishap out of a technological item in the same manner as you could a magical item. When attempting checks as part of such actions, you use Craft (mechanical) in place of your normal associated skill.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
